92	// -- Wave-64 reductions: see the DEVICE pass (§5.0) ---------------------------
93	// NOTE (WS5/item 3 — DPP butterfly, not __shfl_xor): the live softmax wavefront
94	// reductions are in the DEVICE pass below — amd::wave_reduce_add_dpp (SUM, the
95	// primitives header §2.6) and native::wave_reduce_max_dpp (MAX, §5.0). Both are
96	// the explicit __builtin_amdgcn_mov_dpp row-shift + row-broadcast butterfly (one
97	// instruction per step, no LDS round-trip). The earlier __shfl_xor host-block
98	// helpers here were DEAD (never referenced) and were removed: on CDNA3 __shfl_xor
99	// can lower to ds_bpermute (an LDS round-trip), which is exactly the slow path
100	// the explicit DPP butterfly avoids — keeping them invited a future copy-paste
101	// of the wrong primitive into a device kernel.
