727	// §5.LAUNCH  __global__ entry kernels (host launches these via hipLaunchKernelGGL
728	// from the ATen orchestration in the host TU; see the launch note in §5.LAUNCH
729	// above). bf16 tensors flow as raw `short` bit-patterns.
