1964	// ── §5.LAUNCH (host-side wiring — NOW LIVE under __HIPCC__) ───────────────────
1965	// The launchers above are DISPATCHED two ways (per the `#if defined(__HIPCC__)`
1966	// blocks in each launcher):
1967	//   * hipcc build (__HIPCC__): the forward step launches the §5 device kernels
1968	//     (sg2_csa/hca_attention_fwd_mfma for the CSA/HCA QKᵀ / DPP-softmax / O=P·V,
1969	//     sg2_peer_route_kernel for PEER routing, sg2_gru_gate_kernel for the GRU
1970	//     gates); the backward launches the §A device adjoint kernels
